Window KindsDemo "All kinds"
  VGroup root
    Cycle cycColour "Red|Green|Blue" @OnChange=cycColourChange
    Radio radSize "Small|Medium|Don't know" @OnChange=radSizeChange
    Slider sldLevel @OnChange=sldLevelChange :min=-5 :max=20 :value=7
    Gauge gauProgress :max=50 :value=25
    List lstNames "Test" @OnDoubleClick=lstNamesDoubleClick :weight=200
